      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "One run's stored output becomes\ntests/fixtures/runs/2026-09-04_tr.json (schema 1):\nper story the title, summary, why_it_matters, tags,\nimportance, rank — and from the body only its\nnumerals and capitalised tokens.",
      "originalText": "One run's stored output becomes\ntests/fixtures/runs/2026-09-04_tr.json (schema 1):\nper story the title, summary, why_it_matters, tags,\nimportance, rank — and from the body only its\nnumerals and capitalised tokens.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
    },
