      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Re-recording it is a reviewed diff,\nthe same way prompts/*.md are.\npytest reads it with no key and no\nnetwork.",
      "originalText": "Re-recording it is a reviewed diff,\nthe same way prompts/*.md are.\npytest reads it with no key and no\nnetwork.",
