      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "It is also the only way the\ndeterministic checks can be asserted\nin CI: one real run's model output,\nfrozen, so a bound that holds today\nkeeps holding.",
