      "text": "Not style, not length, not\nimportance, not language: Turkish\nquality is judged by the reader,\nnever by a model. A verdict that\nfails to parse is recorded as passed\n= None, not raised.",
      "originalText": "Not style, not length, not\nimportance, not language: Turkish\nquality is judged by the reader,\nnever by a model. A verdict that\nfails to parse is recorded as passed\n= None, not raised.",
